          "filename": "\"Santa Prisca\" parish of Taxco Guerrero.JPG",
          "caption": "The construction of the parish of Santa Prisca lasted a prune more than ten years (February 1748 to December 1758).\nThe construction was carried out by order of Don Jóse de la Borda.\nDon Jóse de la Borda was from Oloron, France. He came to New Spain in 1716 and within a few years became a major employer.\n\nSanta Prisca is a prodigy, where sculpture, painting and architecture come together in symbolism",
